      "created_at": "2022-05-04T07:43:49.314Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hello community, having a small problem where my field’s ability to be Read Only depending on another field is not working.</p>\n<p>So, there’s “Status” field with multiple options, and one of the is “Closed”. I want my fields to be “Read Only” after the status is changed to Closed. I have inserted the following to my field’s “read only depends on” but it’s just not working:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>eval:doc.status = ‘Closed’</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>I’m on v13 of both Frappe and ERPNext. The problem I’m having is no matter what the status is, the field became read only always.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/5/1/5152353a9ae566f2f2abc7c03965fd46e4434488.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/5152353a9ae566f2f2abc7c03965fd46e4434488\" title=\"Screen Shot 2022-05-04 at 3.40.01 PM\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/5/1/5152353a9ae566f2f2abc7c03965fd46e4434488_2_690x267.png\" alt=\"Screen Shot 2022-05-04 at 3.40.01 PM\" data-base62-sha1=\"bBoNTyhw6X40dz3D1LqTTK3zxyM\" width=\"690\" height=\"267\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/5/1/5152353a9ae566f2f2abc7c03965fd46e4434488_2_690x267.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/5/1/5152353a9ae566f2f2abc7c03965fd46e4434488.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/5/1/5152353a9ae566f2f2abc7c03965fd46e4434488.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F4F5F6\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">Screen Shot 2022-05-04 at 3.40.01 PM</span><span class=\"informations\">977×379 12.8 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>Thanks guys!</p>",
