      "cooked": "<p>Hi <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/imoshi\">@iMoshi</a>,</p>\n<p>Please check it.<br>\nIt’s working from my side.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"lang-auto\">eval:doc.status=='Closed'\n</code></pre>\n<p>I try for description.</p>\n<p>It’s writeable<br>\n<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/0/5/05841af6ce848e372d7f3cc9275fc2e7921a2df9.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/05841af6ce848e372d7f3cc9275fc2e7921a2df9\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/0/5/05841af6ce848e372d7f3cc9275fc2e7921a2df9_2_690x254.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"MNq943h1O5vHGZVvn62vF6oc2d\" width=\"690\" height=\"254\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/0/5/05841af6ce848e372d7f3cc9275fc2e7921a2df9_2_690x254.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/0/5/05841af6ce848e372d7f3cc9275fc2e7921a2df9_2_1035x381.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/0/5/05841af6ce848e372d7f3cc9275fc2e7921a2df9.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F9F9FA\"><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1276×471 33.3 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div></p>\n<p>It’s Read Only.<br>\n<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/1/5/1504334485a4be33eb2f12767428bc40f4ab41d9.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/1504334485a4be33eb2f12767428bc40f4ab41d9\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/1/5/1504334485a4be33eb2f12767428bc40f4ab41d9_2_690x225.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"2ZV1Bz